{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Astro</strong> is a multiplayer first person shooter in <strong>zero gravity</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/8fc5bcb703289384f1cb106f57f5998a.avif?t=1758489346\" width=608 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain together dashes, slides, kicks, grapples, and more to reach top speeds! If you\u2019re looking for a new movement shooter to master, look no further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/70a00da9e24c1c38250376aad41c0de7.poster.avif?t=1758489346\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/70a00da9e24c1c38250376aad41c0de7.webm?t=1758489346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/70a00da9e24c1c38250376aad41c0de7.mp4?t=1758489346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/b3ca8da44c8bb19c6e4240f28707a008.avif?t=1758489346\" width=608 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield a diverse arsenal, from classic fps guns to boomerangs and boomboxes. Discover powerful synergies in the hundreds of unique item combinations and craft your ultimate playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/22792fdc33dd6067ff79bed63e7d9d8b.poster.avif?t=1758489346\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/22792fdc33dd6067ff79bed63e7d9d8b.webm?t=1758489346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/22792fdc33dd6067ff79bed63e7d9d8b.mp4?t=1758489346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/f8816c2be9c49f7829aa6c3329d0c09c.avif?t=1758489346\" width=608 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab other players, kick floating cubes, deflect bullets into enemies, or whatever else you can dream up using Astro\u2019s fully sandbox networked physics. The only constraint is your imagination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/bb97568fd6ae4055fc642e1f4917fff3.poster.avif?t=1758489346\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/bb97568fd6ae4055fc642e1f4917fff3.webm?t=1758489346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/bb97568fd6ae4055fc642e1f4917fff3.mp4?t=1758489346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/0cd28a12fbf54bb1d3331bba9afd42d1.avif?t=1758489346\" width=608 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy classic fps game modes like capture the flag or free-for-all, reimagined in a zero gravity environment. And if you\u2019re craving something new, then it\u2019s time to try Fusion, Mag-Tag, or any of Astro\u2019s other original game modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/4c362abbb28eef994fc5831a5b42bae5.poster.avif?t=1758489346\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/4c362abbb28eef994fc5831a5b42bae5.webm?t=1758489346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/4c362abbb28eef994fc5831a5b42bae5.mp4?t=1758489346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/1f1979bc4a3dba40355de4beab58550e.avif?t=1758489346\" width=608 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with your friends for a full stack, or join forces officially by banding together in your own Crew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/6e1f93dec62e8661e87195000b7f8ee1.poster.avif?t=1758489346\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/6e1f93dec62e8661e87195000b7f8ee1.webm?t=1758489346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/6e1f93dec62e8661e87195000b7f8ee1.mp4?t=1758489346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/e2465cac10fa84a501e3ce1f61c4b6d5.avif?t=1758489346\" width=608 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But no description can ever do Astro justice, you need to experience the thrills of zero gravity combat yourself.\u00a0<u>Ready to redefine your idea of what a first person shooter can be?</u> Dive into Astro!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2540620?t=1758489346","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2540620?t=1758489346","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/75783d1174377b65d0171235b8b12d75c4655258/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758489346","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/75783d1174377b65d0171235b8b12d75c4655258/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758489346","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Astro</strong> is a multiplayer first person shooter in <strong>zero gravity</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/8fc5bcb703289384f1cb106f57f5998a.avif?t=1758489346\" width=608 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain together dashes, slides, kicks, grapples, and more to reach top speeds! If you\u2019re looking for a new movement shooter to master, look no further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster